                                                <rect key="frame" x="10" y="248.00000000000003" width="373" height="100.33333333333334"/>
                                                <string key="text">At SyriaBooking.sy, we’re on a mission to transform how people explore and experience Syria — by making travel simpler, smarter, and more accessible for everyone. We’re building the country’s go-to platform for hotel bookings, and we’re looking for passionate individuals to grow with us.</string>
